{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04863","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得深字 · 韦嗣立","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得深字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"层观远沈沈，鸾旗九日临。\n帷宫压水岸，步辇入烟岑。\n枝上萸新采，樽中菊始斟。\n愿陪欢乐事，长与岁时深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦嗣立","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}